    "crewed": false,
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The target takes an extra 1d10 fire damage.</p><p>Once per turn, when you hit a target with a melee weapon attack or a ranged weapon attack using a thrown weapon, you can imbue the attack with this effect. The saving throw DC equals 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength or Constitution modifier. You can use this feat a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-jRh9d0QkVdfZ8t0a\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use the activity after a hit: it spends a use and rolls the extra damage. The once-per-turn limit is not tracked.</p></section>",
